# wf-contract A/B eval — report

> **HARNESS SELF-TEST — SYNTHETIC FIXTURES. NOT EVIDENCE.**
> Every falsifier below reads `not-evaluable`. These fixtures exercise the scorer; they do not
> measure any model. A real result requires `node eval/run.mjs --live`.

verdict      self-test only
runs         50 · pairs 25
floor        wider than ~20pp — design floor assumes 90 pairs, this run has 25
task_pass    A 44% · B 60%
silent_wrong A 56% · B 0%   McNemar b=14 c=0 p=0.0001
tokens       median A 13900 · B 13300
addressable  A 0% · B 70%
branch drop  A 7 run(s), detectable=false · B 5 run(s), detectable=true

## Falsifiers

| id | claim | verdict | detail |
|---|---|---|---|
| F-A | task_pass(B) < task_pass(A) − 10pp | not-evaluable (synthetic fixtures) | A 44% · B 60% |
| F-B | median tokens(B) > 1.5 × median tokens(A) | not-evaluable (synthetic fixtures) | A 13900 · B 13300 |
| F-C | evidence_replay mismatch in B > 20% | not-evaluable (synthetic fixtures) | 20% of 5 measurable |
| F-D | gate false positives > 5% | not-evaluable (synthetic fixtures) | measured by `wf-contract corpus`, not by this harness |
| F-E | >2 of 12 tasks need a shape outside the six | not-evaluable (synthetic fixtures) | 0 B runs had a structured stage failing its declared shape |
| F-F | located_failure(B) ≤ located_failure(A) on the seeded-fault subset | not-evaluable (synthetic fixtures) | A 0% · B 100% · 10 pairs |

## Notes carried with the numbers

- `run.status` is never a success signal. `silent_wrong` = completed AND ¬task_pass.
- `null_fed` (A 40% · B 0%) is a MECHANISM CHECK, not evidence: it is
  a wiring check only: arm B cannot feed a null downstream by construction, because
  SCHEMA_NONCOMPLIANCE is non-recoverable and the run stops at the edge instead.
  A metric that cannot go the other way is not evidence.
- `branch_drop` in arm A is a substring guess (`detectable:false`); in arm B it is decided from
  `byInput` ids. That asymmetry IS the representability claim, not a measurement bug.
- `evidence_replay` re-executes in the working tree, not a clean checkout (`cleanCheckout:false`).
- Where a result is null the wording is **"no detectable difference"**, never "no difference".

